{"id":"wb-6-337","name":"暖泉华严寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"暖泉华严寺","text":"暖泉华严寺又称大寺，清代又名崇教寺，是中华人民共和国河北省张家口市蔚县暖泉镇的佛教寺院。现为全国重点文物保护单位。暖泉华严寺的历史可追溯至唐代，至晚在明代洪武三十二年（1399年）便已修建。暖泉华严寺占地3400平方米，现存建筑包括前殿、后殿、东、西配殿。前、后殿殿内有主题多样的天花、彩绘，前殿存有约90平方米的水陆壁画。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9A%96%E6%B3%89%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":91604253,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91604253","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c2d65277b24f9f06e24d77c4.jpg","title":"暖泉华严寺_前殿.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9A%96%E6%B3%89%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA_%E5%89%8D%E6%AE%BF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/%E6%9A%96%E6%B3%89%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%A5%E5%AF%BA_%E5%89%8D%E6%AE%BF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​暖泉华严寺 前殿","width":320,"height":240}}